\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Sleet_Storm_Icon.webp/20px-Sleet_Storm_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/50/Sleet_Storm_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sleet_Storm\" title=\"Sleet Storm\">Sleet Storm</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/16px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/24px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/32px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/16px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li></ul></li>\n<li>The incantation for Sanctuary is <i>Mactē Virtutē</i>, Latin for \"With great virtue\".</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Creatures affected by Sanctuary can still be targeted with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blight\" title=\"Blight\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Blight_Icon.webp/20px-Blight_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Blight_Icon.webp/30px-Blight_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Blight_Icon.webp/40px-Blight_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blight\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Blight_Icon.webp/20px-Blight_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e0/Blight_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blight\" title=\"Blight\">Blight</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chain_Lightning\" title=\"Chain Lightning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Chain_Lightning_Icon.webp/20px-Chain_Lightning_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Chain_Lightning_Icon.webp/30px-Chain_Lightning_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Chain_Lightning_Icon.webp/40px-Chain_Lightning_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Chain Lightning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Chain_Lightning_Icon.webp/20px-Chain_Lightning_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Chain_Lightning_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Chain_Lightning\" title=\"Chain Lightning\">Chain Lightning</a>, and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thorn_Whip\" title=\"Thorn Whip\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e8/Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp/20px-Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e8/Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp/30px-Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e8/Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp/40px-Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thorn Whip\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e8/Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp/20px-Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e8/Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Thorn_Whip\" title=\"Thorn Whip\">Thorn Whip</a>, due to these spells lacking the <code>IsHarmful</code> spell flag. For the same reason, a large number of <a href=\"/wiki/NPC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"NPC\">NPC</a> actions (for example, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sharp_Rock\" title=\"Sharp Rock\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Generic_Damage_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Damage_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Generic_Damage_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Damage_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Generic_Damage_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Damage_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sharp Rock\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Generic_Damage_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Damage_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Generic_Damage_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sharp_Rock\" title=\"Sharp Rock\">Sharp Rock</a>) can target creatures that are affected by Sanctuary.</li>\n<li>Neutral NPCs (yellow outlined) with Sanctuary can be targeted with attacks.<sup class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">[<a href=\"/wiki/bg3wiki:Verification\" title=\"bg3wiki:Verification\"><span aria-label=\"This worked on the Bhaali...\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"bg3wiki-help-tooltip\"><i>verify</i></span></a>]</sup></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Sanctuary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sanctuary\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- 